{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"5ea2c3ce-bea8-4ce3-8195-f1f0f2991204","agentId":"a05e4fa8a42244885","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 3D container loading / 3D bin packing 文献的最新进展，看哪些技术能迁移到 2D placement / 我们 70x70 设施放置问题。\n\n**背景：** Round 5/6 调研了 2D bin packing 文献（Factorio-SAT、ModRef 2023 等）。但 3D 文献规模通常更大、约束更复杂，可能有更先进的技术。\n\n**调研重点：**\n1. 3D container loading 工业 SOTA（Amazon, DHL, FedEx）\n2. 学术 benchmark：BR、MPV、JCP 等数据集\n3. 主流算法：constructive heuristic + LS + ML hybrid\n4. extreme point / corner point 选择策略\n5. caving degree / floor wall 评估\n6. ML-driven 3D BPP（GOPT, PCT, Conditional Query Learning）\n7. 这些技术对 2D + 强约束（端口/流量）问题的适用性\n8. 3D 中\"重力\" / \"支撑\" 约束跟 2D 的对偶\n9. 3D LBBD（如 Lufthansa ULD scheduling Round 6 提的）\n10. 时序优化（先放大物件，再嵌入小物件）\n\n**输出格式（不超过 1000 字）：**\n- 5-8 个 3D 方法的迁移评估\n- 关键论文链接\n- 末尾\"对 2D placement 真正有用的是哪 1-2 条\"\n\n要具体到方法名 + 学术评分。"},"uuid":"2329f814-5feb-4d79-b9c5-92d4d35077f1","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:01:50.336Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
